WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.718 --> 00:00:13.479
Willow frowned at Ivy's sketch.

2
00:00:13.499 --> 00:00:16.541
"Camp Evergreen is awesome.

3
00:00:16.981 --> 00:00:18.402
All the kids here love it."

4
00:00:18.422 --> 00:00:22.944
"Well, most of the kids," Clara said.

5
00:00:22.964 --> 00:00:26.246
"Why don't you show some Evergreen spirit, Ivy?"

6
00:00:27.207 --> 00:00:29.028
Ivy sighed as the girls hurried away.

7
00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:31.822
Then she walked with Ezra into the mess hall.

8
00:00:32.662 --> 00:00:34.444
They picked up trays and got in line.

9
00:00:34.464 --> 00:00:38.547
"What's this Evergreen spirit stuff?"

10
00:00:39.188 --> 00:00:39.808
Ivy asked.

11
00:00:39.828 --> 00:00:43.631
"It's being happy and excited about camp."

12
00:00:44.452 --> 00:00:45.212
Ezra shrugged.

13
00:00:45.232 --> 00:00:49.476
"It's my third year, and I'm still not happy or excited."

14
00:00:49.496 --> 00:00:53.679
"I'll be excited when I leave," Ivy said.

15
00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:56.982
They got some food and brought it to a table.

16
00:00:58.263 --> 00:00:59.424
A boy sat there alone.

17
00:01:00.864 --> 00:01:03.466
"Glen, this is Ivy," Ezra said.

18
00:01:04.627 --> 00:01:05.328
Glen grinned.

19
00:01:05.348 --> 00:01:06.909
"Hi, Ivy.

20
00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:10.712
If you want to know anything about Camp Evergreen, just ask me.

21
00:01:11.753 --> 00:01:12.834
It's my second summer.

22
00:01:13.635 --> 00:01:14.996
I'm basically an expert."

23
00:01:16.177 --> 00:01:17.818
Ivy stared at the food on her tray.

24
00:01:17.838 --> 00:01:22.943
"My first question is—what's this brown stuff?"

25
00:01:22.963 --> 00:01:26.586
"I think it's hamburger," Glen said.

26
00:01:27.527 --> 00:01:28.688
Ezra sniffed his fork.

27
00:01:30.192 --> 00:01:31.592
"Or it might be tofu."

28
00:01:32.953 --> 00:01:34.153
Ivy frowned at the boys.

29
00:01:34.173 --> 00:01:39.655
"What about this other brown stuff?"

30
00:01:39.675 --> 00:01:41.315
"Oh, that's potato salad!"

31
00:01:41.695 --> 00:01:42.315
Glen said.

32
00:01:43.176 --> 00:01:44.576
Ezra held up his fruit punch.

33
00:01:44.596 --> 00:01:47.337
"This drink is called bug juice."

34
00:01:48.657 --> 00:01:50.858
"Because it's made from squashed bugs!"

35
00:01:55.239 --> 00:01:58.440
Glen laughed so hard, bug juice came out of his nose.

36
00:01:59.024 --> 00:02:00.285
Ivy pushed her tray away.

37
00:02:00.305 --> 00:02:03.527
"I lost my appetite," she said.

38
00:02:05.789 --> 00:02:07.870
Soon Wes Wheezer blew his bugle.

39
00:02:09.211 --> 00:02:12.354
The kids carried their trays and put them in pans for washing.

40
00:02:13.254 --> 00:02:16.657
Then they left for the assembly hall, another room inside the lodge.

41
00:02:17.257 --> 00:02:20.800
As soon as all the kids and counselors were inside, the lights went out.

42
00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:23.301
The room was pitch black.

43
00:02:24.382 --> 00:02:25.723
"Hey, what's going on?"

44
00:02:26.223 --> 00:02:26.824
Ivy asked.

45
00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:28.921
The bugle sounded again.

46
00:02:29.921 --> 00:02:32.102
Then a voice yelled through a loud bullhorn.

47
00:02:32.122 --> 00:02:35.864
"Ever!" "Green!"

48
00:02:36.544 --> 00:02:37.565
everyone shouted back.

49
00:02:37.585 --> 00:02:39.305
Bullhorn: "Never!"

50
00:02:39.325 --> 00:02:41.747
Campers: "Not!"

51
00:02:41.767 --> 00:02:47.229
Bullhorn: "How much camp spirit have you got?"

52
00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:49.630
The lights came on again.

53
00:02:50.791 --> 00:02:53.032
Ivy stared at the strange sight around her.

54
00:02:54.236 --> 00:02:57.819
Most of the kids and counselors were singing a song about Camp Evergreen.

55
00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:00.421
They were also doing a crazy dance.

56
00:03:01.642 --> 00:03:05.285
A few kids like Ivy sat on the floor, watching in confusion.

57
00:03:06.606 --> 00:03:08.888
Ezra was sweating as he tried to do the dance.

58
00:03:10.149 --> 00:03:14.573
Glen was the loudest singer, but his awful voice made Ivy cover her ears.

59
00:03:14.593 --> 00:03:19.617
"Now that's some terrific Camp Evergreen spirit!"

60
00:03:19.877 --> 00:03:20.778
Penelope shouted.

61
00:03:20.798 --> 00:03:24.105
"Indeed," Private said.

62
00:03:24.125 --> 00:03:28.088
"In fact, we're having a contest in a few days.

63
00:03:28.809 --> 00:03:32.052
It's to see who has the most Evergreen spirit."

64
00:03:32.072 --> 00:03:37.216
"So, like, get in groups of three," Larry said.

65
00:03:37.236 --> 00:03:42.901
"And your group should decide, like, how to show the most Evergreen spirit."

66
00:03:42.921 --> 00:03:46.344
"Ugh," Ivy groaned.

67
00:03:46.364 --> 00:03:50.068
"What a dumb idea for a contest."

68
00:03:51.252 --> 00:03:53.253
She went over to join Ezra and Glen.

69
00:03:54.493 --> 00:03:57.554
The three of them listened to the other kids' ideas for a few minutes.

70
00:03:57.574 --> 00:04:01.635
"How about a skit on Camp Evergreen's history?"

71
00:04:02.195 --> 00:04:03.656
Clara suggested to her group.

72
00:04:03.676 --> 00:04:07.277
"We could write a new song," a boy named Richard said.

73
00:04:07.297 --> 00:04:10.758
"We're having an arm-wrestling contest!"

74
00:04:11.138 --> 00:04:12.778
a tough boy named Buck yelled.

75
00:04:12.798 --> 00:04:15.979
"Winners have Evergreen spirit.

76
00:04:16.739 --> 00:04:19.300
Losers are a bunch of wimps who hate camp!"

77
00:04:20.136 --> 00:04:22.537
His friends, Chuck and Huck, laughed.

78
00:04:23.218 --> 00:04:25.299
They grabbed Buck's arms and pulled on them.

79
00:04:26.059 --> 00:04:27.640
All three fell over in a heap.

80
00:04:29.321 --> 00:04:32.443
"Ivy, those wrestlers are the Ucks," Glen said.

81
00:04:33.263 --> 00:04:34.324
She wrinkled her nose.

82
00:04:34.344 --> 00:04:37.906
"Yuck!" Ezra looked nervous.

83
00:04:38.926 --> 00:04:40.767
"What should we do for the contest?"

84
00:04:40.787 --> 00:04:42.468
"I know!"

85
00:04:42.988 --> 00:04:43.629
Ivy whispered.

86
00:04:44.589 --> 00:04:45.710
Ezra looked surprised.

87
00:04:45.730 --> 00:04:46.870
"You do?"

88
00:04:48.031 --> 00:04:48.631
Ivy nodded.

89
00:04:49.865 --> 00:04:52.961
"Let's break out of this prison camp the first chance we get!"
